OL,3,GNEWSAPerson hospitalised after
OL,4,Amotorcycle and van collide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fwith serious injuries after a
OL,8,Fmotorcycle and a van collided on an
OL,9,Fdual carriageway.
OL,11,FLane closures remain in place on the
OL,12,FA34 northbound at the Chiltern
OL,13,FInterchange, after emergency services
OL,14,Fhad to briefly close both sides between
OL,15,Fthe A4185 for Chilton and the A4130 for
OL,16,FDidcot.
OL,18,FThames Valley Police said southbound
OL,19,Fwas now back open but traffic was
OL,20,Fmoving slowly, so advised drivers to
OL,21,Ffind alternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
